```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Cache
    participant DB

    Client->>API: GET /users/42
    API->>Cache: lookup(42)
    alt cache hit
        Cache-->>API: user data
    else cache miss
        API->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id=42
        DB-->>API: row
        API->>Cache: set(42, row)
    end
    API-->>Client: 200 OK
```
